Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:12.11,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,District 4 and 5, keep up your bombardment!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.11,0:00:13.11,Main - Italics,Speaker,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.22,0:00:19.06,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I frequent that super market \Nshooting beams right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.06,0:00:23.50,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,This just shows you Ratatoskr's facilities \Nextend well beyond the underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.99,0:00:27.09,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,All ships! Commence fire \Non the enemy battleships!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.09,0:00:29.50,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Wizard Team, support our Spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:30.50,Main - Italics,Speaker,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:37.27,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Gabriel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.27,0:00:38.48,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Haniel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.01,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Kaleidoscope!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.59,0:00:50.53,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,So this is Gabriel? \NI do feel like it's grown stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.53,0:00:51.25,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:53.57,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Now to just scatter our foes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.50,0:02:32.55,Main,CloneB,0,0,0,,So thrilling, so thrilling!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:38.17,Main,CloneC,0,0,0,,To think they would try \Nto stop me with such forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.17,0:02:40.49,Main,CloneD,0,0,0,,They sure are underestimating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.07,0:02:50.35,Main,CloneB,0,0,0,,Hmph, here come the mass-produced models.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:52.22,Main,Nibeelcole,0,0,0,,Mass-produced models?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.22,0:02:55.21,Main,Nibeelcole,0,0,0,,You're the one person \NI don't want to hear that from.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.21,0:02:57.17,Main,NibeelcoleB,0,0,0,,I've thought this for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.17,0:03:00.49,Main,NibeelcoleB,0,0,0,,but your character overlaps \Nwith ours, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.77,0:03:02.50,Main,CloneE,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:08.25,Main,CloneC,0,0,0,,I'll lay out your heads \Nbefore your beloved "Father".
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:22.13,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.13,0:03:27.47,Main,Mikie,0,0,0,,Captain, this is what Origami \Nwas trying to tell us about, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.98,0:03:29.27,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.78,0:03:33.77,Main,Mikie,0,0,0,,This isn't a fight against Spirits anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:38.42,Main - Italics,Irene,0,0,0,,Hello, captain of the JGSDF's AST.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:43.06,Main - Italics,Irene,0,0,0,,This is Irene Fox from DEM's \NSecond Executive Branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.46,0:03:44.66,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,DEM?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:46.29,Main - Italics,Irene,0,0,0,,Cutting to the point,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:50.06,Main - Italics,Irene,0,0,0,,please follow our orders \Nand charge the Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.06,0:03:51.61,Main - Italics,Irene,0,0,0,,We'll provide cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.61,0:03:54.24,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Huh? What's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:57.85,Main - Italics,Irene,0,0,0,,You all are at least capable of that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.85,0:03:58.79,Main - Italics,Irene,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.17,0:04:05.87,Main,Mikie,0,0,0,,Captain, are we going to follow DEM's orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:11.66,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,If there's a Spirit before us, \Nit's our job to defeat them,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.50,0:04:14.65,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,regardless of DEM's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:16.31,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.77,0:04:24.40,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Be careful of that chill!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:26.61,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,It'll freeze you and your Territory!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.61,0:04:27.49,Main,AST,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:34.62,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.62,0:04:36.54,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Michael, Lataib!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:44.53,Main,Irene,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.65,0:04:54.98,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Hmm, are you all the AST \Nthat Origami mentioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:58.84,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Y-You're a Spirit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:01.43,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,You saved us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.03,0:05:05.48,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,They were intending to use you all as decoys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:06.91,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Don't fall for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.96,0:05:11.86,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,We heard about you from Origami,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.86,0:05:14.14,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,so please get away from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.43,0:05:17.78,Main,Mikie,0,0,0,,C-Captain, are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:18.82,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.82,0:05:20.53,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Thanks to that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.91,0:05:24.10,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,All of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:26.83,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Start preparing to look for another job!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.41,0:05:36.73,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,Artemisia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:37.85,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,Long time, no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.85,0:05:42.11,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,It's Origami Tobiichi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.82,0:05:45.22,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,Seeing you gives me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.33,0:05:49.78,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,Have we met somewhere before?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.08,0:05:53.66,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,You've had your memories manipulated by DEM.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:54.35,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.07,0:05:58.67,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,It's possible for us to cure you of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:00.38,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.75,0:06:04.88,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,that Westcott is deceiving me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.21,0:06:06.02,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.94,0:06:10.59,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:13.89,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,After all, you're Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:24.31,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Whoa, I'm the one you'll be facing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:26.44,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Yoshinon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.44,0:06:27.58,Main,Zadkiel,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:30.20,Main,Zadkiel,0,0,0,,Bad girls get frozen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.20,0:06:37.16,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,Metatron!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.99,0:06:49.72,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,You're quite good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:51.85,Main - Italics,Nia,0,0,0,,Oririn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:53.72,Main - Italics,Nia,0,0,0,,This a little bad news,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.72,0:06:55.85,Main - Italics,Nia,0,0,0,,but Ellen is heading your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.54,0:07:03.61,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,You came, Ellen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:05.73,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Wise judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.01,0:07:07.57,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,You've matured.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:10.14,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.37,0:07:16.79,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Please handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.07,0:07:26.14,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.13,0:07:31.91,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,May I tell a joke to help \Ncalm tensions in the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.90,0:07:33.89,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.73,0:07:38.01,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Let's run, Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.01,0:07:42.02,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Leave behind Ratatoskr, \Nthe Spirits, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.97,0:07:48.45,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,We can go live somewhere \Ntogether, just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.33,0:07:51.78,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,I would like at least three kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:52.78,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:57.28,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,That was my best joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.03,0:08:01.91,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Yeah, you have talent as comedian.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:20.94,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Origami Tobiichi and Mana Takamiya...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.38,0:08:24.94,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Perfect. I'll eliminate you both together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.45,0:08:29.40,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Who goes there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.62,0:08:37.41,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Hey. Long time, no see, Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:42.29,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Did you have fun acting like you're \Nthe strongest in a world without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:45.67,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Elliot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:52.38,Main,NibeelcoleC,0,0,0,,This is lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.38,0:08:57.62,Main,NibeelcoleD,0,0,0,,Right? I can't believe we're being assigned \Nthe boring work of assaulting cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:08:59.18,Main,NibeelcoleE,0,0,0,,Oh, look, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:03.18,Main,NibeelcoleE,0,0,0,,Looks like this might get a little interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.46,0:09:06.90,Main,NibeelcoleG,0,0,0,,Beelzebub Yeled!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.21,0:09:17.61,Main,NibeelcoleC,0,0,0,,So weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:23.08,Main,NibelcooleE,0,0,0,,I wanted to play a bit more, but Father \Nwill get mad if we take too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.37,0:09:26.58,Main,NibeelcoleG,0,0,0,,You're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.89,0:09:37.13,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Leave this place to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.13,0:09:39.47,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Evacuate. Please fall back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:41.41,Main,Wizards,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.25,0:09:44.60,Main,NibeelcoleC,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.09,0:09:47.01,Main,NibeelcoleD,0,0,0,,Princess and Berserk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.01,0:09:49.09,Main,NibeelcoleD,0,0,0,,The fighters are all here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:53.48,Main,NibeelcoleE,0,0,0,,Do you think you can beat us with numbers?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.89,0:09:57.60,Main,NibelcooleC,0,0,0,,With me, one is all, and all are one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.60,0:10:01.60,Main,NibeelcoleD,0,0,0,,No matter how many of us you kill, \Nwe won't die as long as Beelzebub exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:04.08,Main,NibelcooleE,0,0,0,,How do you hope to kill a woman who can't die?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:08.83,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Sorry, Nibeelcole, but we're not your opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:13.02,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,We have someone much better \Nsuited to facing you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.02,0:10:16.72,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Affirmative. We're simply their backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:18.01,Main,NibelcooleC,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.80,0:10:26.49,Main,NibelcooleD,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.53,0:10:44.05,Main,NibeelcoleF,0,0,0,,Shido Itsuka?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:47.41,Main,NibelcooleG,0,0,0,,Wow, that's awfully bold, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.72,0:10:49.86,Main,NibelcooleH,0,0,0,,You are our opponent?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:52.37,Main,NibelcooleH,0,0,0,,Are you underestimating us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.37,0:10:56.42,Main,NibeelcoleI,0,0,0,,If I kill you, then it means \Nmy father has won this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:58.09,Main,NibeelcoleI,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.09,0:11:00.68,Main,Nibeelcole,0,0,0,,Now I'll have a great present for Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.87,0:11:16.07,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Nibeelcole, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:17.07,Main,Nibeelcole,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.95,0:11:23.07,Main,NibeelcoleE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.91,0:11:37.59,Main,NibeelcoleC,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:40.49,Main,Kawagoe,0,0,0,,Nibeelcole eliminated! It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.16,0:11:44.38,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,Nibeelcole is still a Spirit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:48.22,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,Which means Shido's power can seal her, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.63,0:11:51.50,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,Nibeelcole originates from Beelzebub,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:55.63,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,but he didn't manage to steal \Nthe entirety of Nia's crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.10,0:12:00.97,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Meaning I'm still influencing Little Rouge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.97,0:12:06.78,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,So whether or not he can seal them \Ndepends on my affection for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:10.12,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,Yes. This is a vulgar way of putting it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:15.63,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,but they're loose girls whose bodies are \Nhonest no matter how much they say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.94,0:12:16.99,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:23.59,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Now, let's begin, Nibeelcole.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.59,0:12:26.51,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,It's time for our date.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.17,0:12:29.04,Main,NibeelcoleC,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.02,0:12:44.86,Main,NibeelcoleH,0,0,0,,Then I just need to avoid getting close!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:57.42,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Now, who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:13:00.41,Main,NibeelcoleI,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.41,0:13:02.59,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you go, kittens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.49,0:13:14.68,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,The impact's more impressive than I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.68,0:13:16.55,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Way to go, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.55,0:13:19.83,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,I think this what they call unparalleled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.31,0:13:24.35,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Watchful. There seems to be \Nno need for us to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.46,0:13:27.03,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,That's not the case. Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.03,0:13:28.77,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,We won't let you interfere!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.77,0:13:31.12,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Shido, we leave the rest to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.12,0:13:32.76,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You can count on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:34.12,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:38.10,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Give up already. It's no use running.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.10,0:13:39.54,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido! Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.45,0:13:50.76,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,You're impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.17,0:13:52.18,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,So are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.55,0:13:55.06,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,But you can't win just by running.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.19,0:13:58.27,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,I wonder what you're thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:04.09,Main - Italics,Artemisia,0,0,0,,Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.09,0:14:09.43,Main - Italics,Artemisia,0,0,0,,This is Artemisia Ashcroft with DEM's \NSecond Executive Branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:10.94,Main - Italics,Artemisia,0,0,0,,I'm currently engaged with a Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.94,0:14:12.09,Main - Italics,Artemisia,0,0,0,,Lend assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.09,0:14:14.54,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Sorry, but we can't meet your expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.81,0:14:17.18,Main - Italics,Ryoko,0,0,0,,After all, we're unemployed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.72,0:14:29.17,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,A draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.17,0:14:31.60,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,No, it's my win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:32.41,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.59,0:14:36.22,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,It's our win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.28,0:14:37.81,Main,Artemisia,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.45,0:14:40.54,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Michael, Lataib.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.61,0:14:45.25,Main,Mikie,0,0,0,,Was I useful to you, Origami?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.25,0:14:46.14,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.66,0:14:50.45,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,Ultimately our two-stage decoy strategy worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.74,0:14:53.74,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,Though I honestly intended \Nto ask Mana to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.38,0:14:56.20,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I was delayed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:14:59.09,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,It took time for me to handle the Bandersnatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.09,0:15:00.21,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:02.89,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,You made the right decision, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:04.71,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Don't give me that shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.71,0:15:08.23,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Jeez, there's no going back for us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.23,0:15:11.72,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Good bye to my life as a public servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.25,0:15:18.59,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You're the real one, not a clone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.59,0:15:22.24,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm surprised you could tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.24,0:15:23.73,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.90,0:15:34.73,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,This is the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.73,0:15:36.89,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You mustn't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:39.47,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.95,0:15:41.73,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:46.17,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You're making an awfully big deal about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.17,0:15:47.85,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm not just referring to now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.27,0:15:51.95,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm honestly grateful for \Nall the times you've saved me so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.53,0:15:54.93,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I really wanted to tell you that in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.37,0:15:58.26,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,My, my, why thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.67,0:16:03.42,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Then might I have your Spirit power \Nas a show of appreciation?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:05.44,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,That's a different matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.44,0:16:07.77,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.13,0:16:11.78,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Then I'll have to change my approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.75,0:16:20.95,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi, I am grateful to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.58,0:16:23.78,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,But you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.78,0:16:30.46,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I don't recall ever asking you to fight \Nin my stead while I hide from DEM!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.02,0:16:35.09,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I would never be happy if you saved me \Nin exchange for your own life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.91,0:16:38.22,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You underestimate me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.22,0:16:42.52,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,You just need to remain quietly on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.52,0:16:47.12,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Then once the battle is over, \Nyou can greet me with tears of gratitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:50.57,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,and offer your Spirit power up to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.13,0:16:56.02,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,That just means I would \Ndie to you instead of DEM!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.02,0:16:58.74,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I already told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.25,0:17:05.00,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I'll use your Spirit power to go to the past \Nand defeat the Spirit of Origin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:11.53,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,When you next come to, you'll be in \Na new world full of peace and happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.53,0:17:13.56,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You think it'll go that well?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.56,0:17:18.24,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear that from the man \Nwho actually managed to alter the past!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.24,0:17:21.01,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, I did do that, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.01,0:17:22.72,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Once I alter the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.72,0:17:29.22,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,the existence of Spirits \Nand your death will be no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:30.87,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,What are you unsatisfied with about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:36.78,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Then the very fact that you and I met \Nwould also be no more, now wouldn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.28,0:17:39.42,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:41.99,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,And I know you love me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.95,0:17:45.57,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.57,0:17:47.12,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Don't forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.12,0:17:50.31,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I've experienced your memories with Yod!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.78,0:17:53.95,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I know how you feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:57.43,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Even if that is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:18:03.83,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,saying that while you're kissing \Nanother woman is deplorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.46,0:18:07.06,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm truly sorry about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.23,0:18:10.82,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.82,0:18:13.64,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Once this battle is over, \NI'll return to the past!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.64,0:18:14.44,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.44,0:18:18.42,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I won't redo everything, only the bad parts!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.42,0:18:20.90,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'll seal the Spirit of Origin's power,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.90,0:18:23.70,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,and use that power to rewrite history!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.70,0:18:26.70,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'll make it so the misfortune \Nthat befell your friend, you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.70,0:18:31.46,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,and all of the other Spirits never happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.46,0:18:35.59,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,and I'll ensure that I meet you \Nand everyone else once again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:41.21,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'll recreate the ultimate \Nfavorable and happy history!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.21,0:18:44.74,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,What are you...? Do you have any chance to...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.74,0:18:46.75,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You said it yourself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.09,0:18:54.66,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm the only the person in this world \Nwho has successfully rewritten history!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.29,0:19:02.95,Main,Nibeelcole,0,0,0,,Stop ignoring me \Nand creating your own little world!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.30,0:19:10.49,Main,Nibeelcole,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.49,0:19:11.62,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi, dodge!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.25,0:19:24.25,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Dalet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:38.06,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.51,0:19:47.15,Main,Eyepatch,0,0,0,,See? I proved useful, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:49.53,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.53,0:19:53.92,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I hate to admit it, \Nyou proved worth keeping alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.22,0:19:56.73,Main,Eyepatch,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.81,0:20:09.30,Main,Eyepatch,0,0,0,,Be honest with our own feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:29.54,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:39.67,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That clone was cocky, rebellious, \Nmeddlesome, and hopeless...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.19,0:20:44.85,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,but she finally proved useful before dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.11,0:20:52.69,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Shido, do you remember our competition?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.69,0:20:54.54,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Competition?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.54,0:20:56.63,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Whoever makes the other fall for them wins?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:03.29,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Let's continue our chat \Nafter this battle is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.25,0:21:07.15,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Once we've driven away DEM...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.77,0:21:12.50,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind offering you my lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.90,0:21:14.77,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You mean it, Kurumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.77,0:21:18.86,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,That's only if we can defeat DEM.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.13,0:21:22.89,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Can you do that, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.38,0:21:25.25,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Of course I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.25,0:21:26.94,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,If I can't pull that off,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.94,0:21:29.64,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,then how could I face the Spirit of Origin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.98,0:21:33.78,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.11,0:21:41.15,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:55.00,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.333,185.466)}Episode 3
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:55.00,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\an8\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.866,280.399)}The Spirit's Resurrection
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:40.02,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\fnTimes New Roman\bord1\blur3\shad1\fs16\pos(604,309.733)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3D3D3D&\shad0\3a&H60&}Episode 4 "The Spirit of Origin"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.75,0:23:28.86,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,That is a memory of a distant past,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.47,0:23:31.77,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,and the tale of how Mio and Shinji met.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.80,0:23:36.18,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,Next Episode is Episode 4: \NThe Spirit of Origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.74,0:23:39.33,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,I'll never let go of you again.
